  "label": "A pug with a bandage on its forehead is requesting intervention regarding bullying",
  "description": "The pug, appearing sad or injured with a pink bandage on its forehead, is the central visual element. The text overlay asks if the viewer will tell a cat (implied as a bully) that bullying is not okay. The scene interprets the pug as a victim of bullying, and the text as a plea for intervention. The spatial arrangement places the pug centrally, with text positioned above and below its head, creating a direct visual and textual relationship.",
